{"seq":3,"slug":"disk-quota-node-replacement-incident","title":"磁盘配额、DB 膨胀与节点替换故障处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/disk-quota-node-replacement-incident","wordCount":2272,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"磁盘配额-db-膨胀与节点替换故障处置\">磁盘配额、DB 膨胀与节点替换故障处置</h1><p>跨境订单控制面最常见的「半夜电话」里，有两种不是网络问题而是磁盘问题：某成员 backend 触顶 <code>NOSPACE</code>，集群整体进入只读，所有 <code>Put</code>/<code>LeaseGrant</code> 返回 gRPC code 8；或者一台成员永久掉盘需要替换，运维先 <code>member remove</code> 再 <code>member add</code>，把集群推到 quorum 边缘。前者意味着下单、库存预占、分布式锁全部停摆；后者可能从「两台可用」变成「零台永久失效」。本文把 quota 触顶的恢复链、DB 膨胀的根因、以及 failed member 的安全替换流程串成一条 runbook。成员身份与 quorum 的关系见同章 <a href=\"cluster-membership-quorum-model\">集群成员、quorum 与重配置模型</a>，backend 三元组与快照恢复见 <a href=\"snapshot-backup-defrag-restore\">快照备份、碎片整理与灾难恢复流程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-quota-alarm-fragmentation-与成员身份四元组\">核心概念：quota、alarm、fragmentation 与成员身份四元组</h2><p>etcd 的「磁盘故障」不是一个量，而是四个相互独立的量在各自触顶：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>观测指标</th>\n<th>触顶后果</th>\n<th>恢复动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>backend 配额</td>\n<td><code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code> vs <code>etcd_server_quota_backend_bytes</code></td>\n<td>集群级 <code>NOSPACE</code> alarm，<strong>只读模式</strong>（仅接受读与删除）</td>\n<td>compact → defrag → <code>alarm disarm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碎片率</td>\n<td><code>in_use / total</code> 比值</td>\n<td>空间无法还给文件系统；配额逼近时先撞墙</td>\n<td><code>defrag</code>（逐成员、阻塞该成员读写）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘延迟</td>\n<td><code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code>、<code>etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>选举抖动、proposal 失败、成员掉队</td>\n<td>换 SSD / 独占 IOPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成员可用数</td>\n<td><code>member list</code> 与 learner 标志</td>\n<td>低于 quorum 则<strong>永久丢失</strong>共识</td>\n<td>安全替换，绝不并发改两台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键分界点：<strong>配额是「逻辑容量」上限，由 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 设定；磁盘是「物理容量」上限，由 SSD 大小决定。</strong> 配额触顶靠 compact/defrag/提额，磁盘打满只能加盘或删数据。这两个数字在源码里是硬编码常量：<code>DefaultQuotaBytes = 2 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024</code>（2 GiB）、<code>MaxQuotaBytes = 8 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024</code>（8 GiB），见 <a href=\"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/blob/release-3.6/server/storage/quota.go\">etcd server/storage/quota.go</a>。即<strong>无论 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 写多大，etcd 硬上限是 8 GiB</strong>；若 8 GiB 仍不够，问题在数据模型而非配额。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 backend 文件总大小、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{in-use}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为压缩后真实占用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>headroom</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>quota</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = 1 - \\frac{S_{\\text{in-use}}}{S_{\\text{total}}}, \\qquad \\text{headroom} = S_{\\text{quota}} - S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">headroom</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quota</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>in-use</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}} \\ge S_{\\text{in-use}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>只 compact 不 defrag 时 headroom 不会增长</strong>——这是「明明删了 key 却仍然 NOSPACE」的唯一解释。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[写入放大 / 无自动压缩] --&gt; B[backend total 逼近 quota]&#10;    B --&gt; C{任一成员超过 quota?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[正常读写]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[集群级 NOSPACE alarm&lt;br/&gt;所有成员进入只读]&#10;    E --&gt; F[排空无用 keyspace + compact 到最新 revision]&#10;    F --&gt; G[逐成员 defrag&lt;br/&gt;归还碎片给文件系统]&#10;    G --&gt; H[total 回落到 in_use 附近]&#10;    H --&gt; I[etcdctl alarm disarm]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Put 恢复成功]&#10;    J --&gt; K{配置问题还是数据问题?}&#10;    K --&gt;|数据模型| L[拆分 keyspace / 缩短 revision 保留]&#10;    K --&gt;|配置| M[调大 quota 或开启 auto-compaction]\">flowchart TD\n    A[写入放大 / 无自动压缩] --&gt; B[backend total 逼近 quota]\n    B --&gt; C{任一成员超过 quota?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[正常读写]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[集群级 NOSPACE alarm&lt;br/&gt;所有成员进入只读]\n    E --&gt; F[排空无用 keyspace + compact 到最新 revision]\n    F --&gt; G[逐成员 defrag&lt;br/&gt;归还碎片给文件系统]\n    G --&gt; H[total 回落到 in_use 附近]\n    H --&gt; I[etcdctl alarm disarm]\n    I --&gt; J[Put 恢复成功]\n    J --&gt; K{配置问题还是数据问题?}\n    K --&gt;|数据模型| L[拆分 keyspace / 缩短 revision 保留]\n    K --&gt;|配置| M[调大 quota 或开启 auto-compaction]</pre><h2 id=\"nospace-告警处置-从只读模式恢复的完整链\">NOSPACE 告警处置：从只读模式恢复的完整链</h2><p>当任一成员的 backend 超过配额，etcd <strong>不是</strong>让那台成员单独只读，而是升起<strong>集群级</strong> alarm，所有成员进入维护模式，仅接受读与删除（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd v3.6 op-guide/maintenance</a>）。客户端收到 gRPC code 8：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"etcdserver: mvcc: database space exceeded\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>etcdserver: mvcc: database space exceeded</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个反直觉的细节：<code>Put</code>、<code>Txn</code>、<code>LeaseGrant</code> 可能返回 <code>ErrGRPCNoSpace</code> <strong>而事务在内部仍然成功</strong>——etcd 在 API 层与 Apply 层都检查配额，Apply 层升 alarm 时不一定阻断本次事务。看到 code 8 不能假设「这次写没落库」：恢复后必须用读校验收敛而非重放写，否则可能写出重复的库存预占记录。</p>\n<p>恢复链固定四步，缺一不可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl endpoint status --write-out=table     # 看每台 DB SIZE / DB SIZE IN USE&#10;etcdctl alarm list                            # 确认 alarm:NOSPACE 的来源成员&#10;rev=$(etcdctl endpoint status --write-out=json | grep -o &#39;&quot;revision&quot;:[0-9]*&#39; | grep -o &#39;[0-9]*&#39;)&#10;etcdctl compact &quot;$rev&quot;                        # 压缩到最新 revision&#10;etcdctl defrag --cluster                      # 逐成员整理，归还磁盘&#10;etcdctl alarm disarm                          # 清 alarm，恢复写入&#10;etcdctl put healthcheck ok                    # 验证真的恢复\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write-out=table</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 看每台 DB SIZE / DB SIZE IN USE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                            # 确认 alarm:NOSPACE 的来源成员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write-out=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '\"revision\":[0-9]*'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[0-9]*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compact</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$rev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                        # 压缩到最新 revision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cluster</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 逐成员整理，归还磁盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disarm</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 清 alarm，恢复写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> put</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ok</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 验证真的恢复</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>compact</code> 到「最新 revision」等于放弃全部历史版本——依赖「从某个 revision 开始 watch」的消费者（Istio、控制器、库存同步器）会收到压缩错误并被强制重新 list 全量，这在跨境系统里是一次全量同步风暴，<strong>应在业务低峰执行</strong>并提前通知订阅方。要保留历史就改为 compact 到 <code>latest - N</code>，代价是 headroom 只增加压缩掉的那部分。</p>\n<p>监控不该等到 NOSPACE 才动。etcd 官方 mixin 有三条直接相关的规则（<a href=\"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/blob/main/contrib/mixin/alerts/alerts.libsonnet\">etcd contrib/mixin/alerts</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>告警</th>\n<th>表达式（核心部分）</th>\n<th>严重级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>etcdDatabaseQuotaLowSpace</code></td>\n<td><code>db_total_size_in_bytes / quota_backend_bytes * 100 &gt; 95</code></td>\n<td>critical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etcdExcessiveDatabaseGrowth</code></td>\n<td><code>predict_linear(db_total_size_in_bytes[4h], 4*3600) &gt; quota_backend_bytes</code></td>\n<td>warning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etcdDatabaseHighFragmentationRatio</code></td>\n<td><code>in_use / total &lt; 0.5</code> 且 <code>in_use &gt; 104857600</code>（100 MiB）</td>\n<td>warning</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条的 <code>for</code> 都是 10m。<code>etcdExcessiveDatabaseGrowth</code> 用 <code>predict_linear</code> 按过去 4 小时速率外推未来 4 小时是否撞配额——这是唯一给出<strong>提前量</strong>的规则，跨境大促前必须接到值班告警。碎片率规则里的 100 MiB 下限同样重要：小集群上 <code>in_use/total &lt; 0.5</code> 是常态，不设下限会天天误报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"db-膨胀的根因-默认不压缩与写入放大\">DB 膨胀的根因：默认不压缩与写入放大</h2><p><code>--auto-compaction-retention</code> 默认值是 <code>&quot;0&quot;</code>，即<strong>默认禁用自动压缩</strong>。这是生产集群突然 NOSPACE 的头号原因：测试环境跑几天、上线后没人补配置，几个月后高频 watch 与更新把 revision 推到百万级，backend 一路涨到 2 GiB 撞墙。两种模式（见 <code>op-guide/maintenance</code>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>periodic</code>（默认）：<code>--auto-compaction-retention=1h</code> 保留 1 小时历史。保留期 &gt; 1 小时时<strong>首次压缩在保留期结束后、之后每小时一次</strong>；≤ 1 小时时按保留间隔压缩。</li>\n<li><code>revision</code>：<code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision --auto-compaction-retention=1000</code> 保留 1000 个 revision，每 5 分钟检查一次，压缩到 <code>latest - 1000</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>官方取值建议很具体：频繁更新的 key 用 <code>1h</code>/<code>30m</code>，低频更新用 <code>24h</code>/<code>48h</code>/<code>72h</code>，通用推荐 <code>10h</code>。跨境库存这类秒级更新的 keyspace 取 <code>30m</code>–<code>1h</code>。</p>\n<p>第二类根因是「一个 key 太大」。两个易被忽略的请求上限：<code>--max-request-bytes</code> 默认 <code>1,572,864</code>（1.5 MiB）、<code>--max-txn-ops</code> 默认 <code>128</code>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/configuration/\">etcd v3.6 configuration</a>）。若某服务把整份配置或大 JSON blob 写进 etcd，一次写就能撑爆大半个配额。etcd 只适合「小、频繁、强一致」的控制面数据；&gt; 1 MiB 的 value 应进对象存储，etcd 里只留指针。</p>\n<p>第三类是 raft 日志的内存压力。<code>--snapshot-count</code> 控制在内存保留多少条已应用条目后触发快照并截断 raft 日志，默认值几经反复：v3.2 前 <code>10000</code>，v3.2 起 <code>100000</code>，v3.6 又<strong>改回 <code>10000</code></strong>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/upgrades/upgrade_3_6/\">etcd v3.6 upgrade guide</a>）。文档警告该值超过 10 万会因 Go GC 压力降低写吞吐。</p>\n<p>容量反推可参照官方硬件档位（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/hardware/\">etcd v3.6 hardware guide</a>）：Small/Medium/Large/xLarge 四档对应存储数据 ≤100 MB、≤500 MB、≤1 GB、&gt;1 GB。注意这是 <strong>in-use 量级</strong>而非 backend 文件大小；按 2× 碎片余量规划，Large 档就要预留约 2 GB——逼近默认 2 GiB 配额，所以 Large 及以上必须显式调大 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 并配置自动压缩。磁盘侧最小门槛是 50 sequential IOPS（7200 RPM 机械盘），重载集群需 500 sequential IOPS（本地 SSD）；云盘「并发 IOPS 常是顺序 IOPS 的 10 倍」，必须用 <code>fio</code>/<code>diskbench</code> 实测顺序值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节点替换-failed-member-的移除与重建\">节点替换：failed member 的移除与重建</h2><p>「replace a failed machine = remove then add」是官方的单行概括，但中间的每个空档都在消耗 quorum，顺序与等待点极其关键（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/runtime-configuration/\">etcd v3.6 runtime reconfiguration</a>）。三节点集群一台永久掉盘的流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl --endpoints=&lt;s1&gt;:2379,&lt;s2&gt;:2379 member list                # 1. 定位失效成员 ID&#10;etcdctl --endpoints=&lt;s1&gt;:2379,&lt;s2&gt;:2379 member remove &lt;MEMBER_ID&gt;  # 2. 移除&#10;etcdctl --endpoints=&lt;s1&gt;:2379,&lt;s2&gt;:2379 \\&#10;  member add etcd-node-4 --peer-urls=http://10.240.0.16:2380       # 3. 注册替代成员&#10;etcd --name etcd-node-4 --data-dir=data.etcd \\&#10;  --initial-advertise-peer-urls http://10.240.0.16:2380 --listen-peer-urls http://10.240.0.16:2380 \\&#10;  --advertise-client-urls http://10.240.0.16:2379 --listen-client-urls http://10.240.0.16:2379 \\&#10;  --initial-cluster &#39;n1=http://10.240.0.13:2380,n2=http://10.240.0.14:2380,n4=http://10.240.0.16:2380&#39; \\&#10;  --initial-cluster-state existing --initial-cluster-token my-etcd-token-1  # 4. 以 existing 启动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">1></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">2></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> member</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 1. 定位失效成员 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">1></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">2></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> member</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">MEMBER_I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 2. 移除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">1></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">2></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:2379</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  member</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> etcd-node-4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --peer-urls=http://10.240.0.16:2380</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 3. 注册替代成员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> etcd-node-4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir=data.etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-advertise-peer-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://10.240.0.16:2380</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --listen-peer-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://10.240.0.16:2380</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --advertise-client-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://10.240.0.16:2379</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --listen-client-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://10.240.0.16:2379</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'n1=http://10.240.0.13:2380,n2=http://10.240.0.14:2380,n4=http://10.240.0.16:2380'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster-state</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --initial-cluster-token</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-etcd-token-1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 4. 以 existing 启动</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个必须记住的坑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>复用旧磁盘会静默退出。</strong> 官方替换流程专门警告「If the new member starts from the same disk space, make sure to remove the data directory of the old member」；残留的 member ID 会让新进程检测到身份冲突后自动退出。</li>\n<li><strong>新成员在注册那一刻就计入 quorum，即使它还连不上。</strong> <code>member add</code> 是投票成员变更，若新成员因 peer URL 写错或网络不通起不来，集群可能直接掉到 quorum 以下。官方因此把 <code>-strict-reconfig-check</code> <strong>默认开启</strong>——重配置后若已启动成员会低于新配置的 quorum，变更被拒绝。</li>\n<li><strong>变更必须串行。</strong> 移除到加回之间，集群处于「两台成员、quorum=2」的脆弱态，不要在这个窗口里同时做 defrag 或另一次成员变更。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>比「移除+添加」更安全的是 <strong>learner 三步法</strong>（v3.4+）：先以非投票成员加入，等 raft 日志追平后再提升：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl member add etcd-node-4 --peer-urls=http://10.240.0.16:2380 --learner&#10;etcdctl member promote &lt;LEARNER_MEMBER_ID&gt;   # 等其日志追平 leader 后再执行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> member</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> etcd-node-4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --peer-urls=http://10.240.0.16:2380</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --learner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> member</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> promote</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEARNER_MEMBER_I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 等其日志追平 leader 后再执行</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>promote</code> 有服务端安全校验：只有「与 leader 同步」的 learner 能被提升，否则返回 <code>etcdserver: can only promote a learner member which is in sync with leader</code>；对非 learner 返回 <code>can only promote a learner member</code>。learner 数量受 <code>--max-learners</code> 限制（v3.4 时代每集群仅一个，后续版本由该 flag 放宽）。它的价值正在于<strong>消除了上面第 2 个坑</strong>：新成员追平前不投票，不会因起不来而拖垮 quorum。跨境跨区部署（成员分散在多个 region、RTT 高、追赶慢）尤其该用 learner 做替换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战处置顺序-症状到动作的对照\">实战处置顺序：症状到动作的对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>先确认</th>\n<th>立即动作</th>\n<th>禁止动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Put</code> 返回 code 8 / <code>database space exceeded</code></td>\n<td><code>alarm list</code> 是否 <code>NOSPACE</code></td>\n<td>低峰 compact → 逐成员 defrag → <code>alarm disarm</code></td>\n<td>直接 <code>alarm disarm</code>（立刻复发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code> 涨势异常</td>\n<td>自动压缩是否被禁用</td>\n<td>配置 <code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision</code> 或 <code>periodic</code></td>\n<td>无脑调大 quota 掩盖数据模型问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>in_use/total 长期 &lt; 0.5 且 &gt; 100 MiB</td>\n<td>上次 defrag 时间</td>\n<td>择机逐成员 <code>defrag</code>，保持 quorum</td>\n<td>同时在多台上 defrag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一台成员永久失效</td>\n<td><code>member list</code> 与 quorum 数</td>\n<td>learner 三步替换法</td>\n<td>并发 <code>remove</code> 两台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贯穿全表的一条纪律：<strong>任何写操作前先问「现在还有几个投票成员」</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 的容错是硬边界——三台集群在失去两台的那一刻永久丢失 quorum，此时 compact、defrag、<code>alarm disarm</code> 全部无效，唯一出路是从快照 <code>etcdutl snapshot restore</code> 重建，且所有成员必须恢复自同一快照。配合 <code>--bump-revision</code> 与 <code>--mark-compacted</code> 可把恢复后的 revision 一次性推高，避免陈旧 watch 缓存读到被回退的历史（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/recovery/\">etcd v3.6 disaster recovery</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>配额与磁盘是两个独立上限。</strong> <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> 硬上限 8 GiB（默认 2 GiB，常量 <code>DefaultQuotaBytes</code>/<code>MaxQuotaBytes</code>）；物理盘另算，两者分别监控。</li>\n<li><strong>NOSPACE 是集群级只读。</strong> 恢复固定为 compact → defrag → <code>alarm disarm</code>；只 compact 不 defrag 不增加 headroom，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不变。</li>\n<li><strong>DB 膨胀的头号原因是默认禁用自动压缩</strong>（<code>--auto-compaction-retention=0</code>）。跨境秒级更新 keyspace 取 <code>30m</code>–<code>1h</code>，并用 mixin 的 <code>predict_linear</code> 规则提前告警。</li>\n<li><strong>节点替换＝learner 式串行变更。</strong> 优先 learner 三步法（add <code>--learner</code> → promote），它不把未就绪的新成员计入 quorum；<code>-strict-reconfig-check</code> 默认开启，是防止重配置自杀的护栏。</li>\n<li><strong>所有动作前先数投票成员。</strong> 低于 quorum 时唯一出路是快照重建，且快照必须所有成员同源、经过实际演练。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"磁盘配额、DB 膨胀与节点替换故障处置","id":"磁盘配额-db-膨胀与节点替换故障处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：quota、alarm、fragmentation 与成员身份四元组","id":"核心概念-quota-alarm-fragmentation-与成员身份四元组"},{"level":2,"text":"NOSPACE 告警处置：从只读模式恢复的完整链","id":"nospace-告警处置-从只读模式恢复的完整链"},{"level":2,"text":"DB 膨胀的根因：默认不压缩与写入放大","id":"db-膨胀的根因-默认不压缩与写入放大"},{"level":2,"text":"节点替换：failed member 的移除与重建","id":"节点替换-failed-member-的移除与重建"},{"level":2,"text":"实战处置顺序：症状到动作的对照","id":"实战处置顺序-症状到动作的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"快照备份、碎片整理与灾难恢复流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/cluster-maintenance/snapshot-backup-defrag-restore"},"next":{"title":"线性一致性读路径模型：ReadIndex 与 Lease Read","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/consistency-observability/linearizability-read-path-model"}}